est/open cohort shown)\n\nBoth parts of the task were completed: the university was identified through proper filtering (Master's Degree + Computer Science), the specific program page was visited, and the application deadline was accurately extracted. The response is fully consistent with the screenshot evidence, with no contradictions.\n\n## Verdict\n**SUCCESS**",
